  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-formula-card\"><header><h3>s3.trajectory-resample</h3><span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--derived\" data-provenance=\"derived\">curated formula</span></header><div><pre class=\"lens-tex\">\\term{progress}{q_k}=\\begin{cases}\\term{total}{Q}\\term{index}{k}/(\\term{count}{n}-1)&amp;\\text{time or arc length},\\ \\term{count}{n}&gt;1\\\\\\term{offset}{c}+\\term{index}{k}\\term{step}{h}&amp;\\text{clock}\\end{cases},\\quad \\term{position}{p_k}=\\term{interpolate}{I}(\\term{start}{a},\\term{end}{b},\\term{fraction}{t})</pre><p class=\"lens-ascii\">Target progress q[k]=Q*k/(n-1) for time or arc-length spacing with n&gt;1 (0 for n=1); clock mode uses clockOffset+k*clockStep. Locate the bracketing progress rows and interpolate p[k]=I(a,b,t), linearly or spherically. Empty non-clock tracks output zero; absent clock samples are NaN. Clock sampleTimes are k*clockStep relative to clock start, while other sampleTimes are relative to track start.</p></div><div class=\"lens-symbols\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis-trajectory-resample-compiled:trajectory-resample-samples\" data-value=\"progress\">progress · intermediate · targetProgress</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis-trajectory-resample-compiled:trajectory-resample-arc-length\" data-value=\"total\">total · input · total</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis-trajectory-resample-compiled:trajectory-resample-samples\" data-value=\"count\">count · parameter · SAMPLE_COUNT</button><span class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--unknown\" data-value=\"offset\">offset · parameter · unknown — wgsl getClockOffset not found in this record</span><span class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--unknown\" data-value=\"step\">step · parameter · unknown — wgsl clockStep not found in this record</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis-trajectory-resample-compiled:trajectory-resample-samples\" data-value=\"position\">position · output · samples</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis-trajectory-resample-compiled:trajectory-resample-samples\" data-value=\"start\">start · input · startPosition</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis-trajectory-resample-compiled:trajectory-resample-samples\" data-value=\"end\">end · input · endPosition</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis-trajectory-resample-compiled:trajectory-resample-arc-length\" data-value=\"fraction\">fraction · input · fraction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis-trajectory-resample-compiled:trajectory-resample-arc-length\" data-value=\"interpolate\">interpolate · intermediate · interpolatePosition</button><span class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--unbound\" data-value=\"index\">index · index · unbound — no binding declared</span></div><div class=\"lens-kernels\"></div><p>apple</p></section>",
